test_group("3.5.0 W2: a ray within 2^-48 of a long axis, solved exactly where it can cross the barrel");
# The fine d_perp is good to about 2^-104 |d|: a barrel root from a d_perp under 2^-48 |d| is solved exactly when
# the barrel can be crossed on the segment; a ray along an ordinary capsule's axis, which cannot, is not.
# The long axes: end = lam d rounded, start = that rounding plus an offset (generic d and lam), the barrel crossed on
# the segment.
# [measured: scratch W2 ev.py lr / lro / lgo / axr / lgate, exact Fractions, merged base and mutants, 2026-11-14]
# (lr seed 2 row 412: exact 0x3E9C4F196D8CF26F; 3.4.2 and base 0x3E9C4F196D8CF25D, 18.09 ulp)
