# 23.5 eps deep, exact 3.91994105530488502e-13; the rim form answers 0x3D5B95880FF1C000, 1e-5 eps below it,
# its normal 7.9e-12 rad off; comparing the two (hr < dn) answers the face's 0x3D5B670000000000, 0.077 eps
# below. The first wave-2 form answered EPA's face form, 0x3D5B910000000000 (0.0075 eps below, 2.0e-8 rad):
# its band took nd only where lower, and the rim form, 0.0075 eps above that, is a tie (_ga_cf_ties).
# [measured: scratch W3 py/gen.py family fo2 scene 2304, py/ana.py, this tree with and without it; 2026-11-14]
# [measured: scratch W3 fix py/pinerr.py, a trace of this scene, this tree and a copy with hr < dn; 2026-11-14]
_w2W3_cyl(0x3FB5FC423D4B6140, 0x3FE1FA77073C35FA, 0xBFECFE9AD5AA44B8, 0x3FD841E5892FD309, 0x3FE9C2417B7BB475,
  0x3FDD37062E80BEA5, 0x3FF2C91669F482F1, 0x3FECEA8FB5305F88);
